{
  "name" : "Lee2017 - Paracetamol first-pass metabolism PK model",
  "description" : "Authors developed a microfluidic gut-liver co-culture chip that aims to reproduce the first-pass metabolism of oral drugs. The study suggests the possibility of reproducing the human PK profile on a chip, contributing to accurate prediction of pharmacological effect of drugs.",
  "format" : {
